  "description": "Nothing is more important to 4-year-old Kim Astiae than her daddy, a holy knight from another world. So when she gets news of his sudden death, she's desperate to save him. What better way than time travel? A mysterious creature tied to her dad's past offers to transport her back in time and to his world. The only catch is they arrive before she was born! Can Tiae find her dad when he doesn't even know her? Maybe her new mercenary friends and newly awakened necromancer powers can help her out... \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
